   "body": "Round 1 handled in 279ec7f (one commit): finding 1 (new test: authored lot order, fails with a plain `sorted`) and finding 2 (a feature with no live lot is skipped; same test). Finding 3 left as is: the 5-card layout already existed for the grid, a cosmetic gap the orchestrator can accept or ask for. The APPROVE above was on 10b2bcc; the delta is a test plus a 2-line `continue`, so a re-review is the orchestrator's call. No macOS job runs (Linux-only paths: `tooling/`, `scripts/`).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
